Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, where's Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have shown up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they don't have all the\Nbattles up on the feet yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, knowing Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should have seen him running\Naround guns blazing from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the craftiest\Nplayers I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably laying low somewhere waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the competition to\Nkill each other off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I both know he\Ndoesn't play like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides that, he's so fast, I\Ndoubt he'll even show up on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll sneak up and strike before\Nhis enemy knows what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't do it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a game with\Nguns and he's using a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dupe thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of a dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one guy's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the one in white?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's super fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's going to win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your boy's full of suck, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, he's not out of it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of paralysis attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he was hit with\Nthat wind spell, Thunderweb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.73,0:02:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.01,0:02:23.85,OP-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Without a second thought, right now
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.01,0:02:23.85,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k30}May{\k27}owa{\k26}zu {\k12}ni {\k22}i{\k167}ma
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh
