Dialogue: 3,0:03:51.02,0:03:55.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,802.5)\clip(0,809,1920,810)\bord0\blur0.75\c&HCD9E12&}Death Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, shoot! Huh? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the guy in the cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him fire that gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, he knew I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he spotted me earlier, got\Nmy position from the last scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jesus, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun is my name,\Nand the name of my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day I'll pay you all\Na visit too and bring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:06:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,real death with this gun\Nyou've seen my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is real this isn't over not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started it's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've met that person before, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one place I could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heingrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to scare the hell out of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me. No way. Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forget the handle he used, but it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was in Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the knife wielder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure it's not Pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about the way this\Nguy talks and acts is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for that show timeline, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pooh was the only one who said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this guy, he was close to Pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking right-hand man close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's death gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those rumors about players\Ngetting shot and disappearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are all true. Yeah. They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he does it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's been killing\Nplayers in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not two people have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been confirmed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, watch the bridge for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check the scan and\Nsee what Nimi's going by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have moved that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pal in the cloak isn't\Nshowing up on the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is he jumped in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm right, then he had to\Ndisable his gear like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about his handgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can still move underwater\Nwith that equipped, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he could, it's\Njust one little handgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could take him out easy with my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:09:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used that little\Ngun to kill Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is one shot. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One shot and you're dead for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well I'm not\Nbuying it. How is it even
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possible i mean a player\Nkilling people iRL
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy but it's the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this death gun guy\Nkilled a lot of people in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that VR MMO I was in\Nwhen he used his sword
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on someone he knew he\Nwas really killing them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a killer, a murderer, in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:09:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm still not convinced\Nwhat you told me is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think you're\Nlying to me about it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't ask for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, we better\Nget out of the area ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others know we're here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think we're busy fighting each\Nother, so they'll be closing in soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll split up here then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.49,0:10:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going after Death Gun, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time we see each other, I'll\Ngive you the fight I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for hearing me out just\Nnow instead of shooting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Death Gun guy seems pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he kills you, you\Nwon't be able to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fan of teaming up either,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think we stand a\Nbetter chance of knocking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that guy out of the game\Nif we work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not down with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any idea\Nwhere he'll pop up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it'll be dangerous whether\Nwe're together or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better take care of this, Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll block his bullets,\Nyou wait for an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun's probably\Nheading north of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be there when he surfaces,\Nbut I don't know where he'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got any ideas, Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he's got\Nany other special skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but from what I've seen, he's a sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.07,0:12:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to avoid open spaces\Nand look for a place with cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:13:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were him, I'd set myself\Nup in the ruins of that city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's where you and me are gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your six.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In SAO, we had a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never let another player's\NHP hit zero, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew, if it dropped to\Nnothing, that player would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They killed dozens,\Nno, hundreds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The assault team had to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They put a party together to\Nhunt him down, and capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kazuto was there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was up front, going toe-to-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything went to hell pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that's why Kazuto's\Nbeen acting so weird lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying to settle\Nsome grudge or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grudge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this supposed to be a part-time job?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm logging out for a bit. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get in touch\Nwith Kirito's client.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's got a client? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who got\NKirito to dive into GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he knows what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need your\Nhelp while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out anything you can about GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we might have passed\Nhim on the way over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we didn't pass him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was keeping an eye on the river\Nthe whole time we were running.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the river dead ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he must be lurking\Naround somewhere in the city now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When his location pops\Nup in the next scan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll rush him before\Nhe can kill anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will we know who Death Gun is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's not his\Navatar's handle, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's start with what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't recognize\Nthe names of three new players.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not Pale Rider, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves us with two names\Nin play that could be Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jushi X and Sterben.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're both in this city, we\Ncan't afford to pick the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Japanese, the Shi in\NJushi means death. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the X could mean cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like making the sign of the cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's too obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't Avatar names\Nusually simple and obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's a variation on\Nmy real name. And yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they're both here,\Nwe'll go after Jushie X first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and if I get paralyzed\Nlike Pale Rider, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get into position and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deathgun's probably\Nhiding somewhere close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he comes out to finish me\Noff, that's when you shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried I'll shoot you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I'd\Nexpect to play it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but once we get\Nhim, all bets are off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, check the north side of the map.
