Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the only one in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he's our man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't see Sterben around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.97,0:17:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jushi-X and Death Gun are one in the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he's going after... him.
