Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rikoko's almost in range. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found him. Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably waiting for Rikoko\Nto walk right up into his sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll attack Jushi-X from\Nbehind while I got the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That building in front\Nof the stadium might
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be a good place for you\Nto get into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can fight way better\Nknowing you got my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a team, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm gonna need is 30 seconds to get up\Nthere and I'll be ready to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that enough time for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Plenty. Cool. See you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Death Gun's gone,\Nwe'll be enemies again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot him, beat\Nhim, and then forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'll ever\Nsee him again after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun's supposed to be in the stadium!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wherever you are, it's time I found out\Nif you were the real deal or a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember how you fought\Nback then, all fury and rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I kill this friend of yours and\Nyou go berserk like I remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.57,0:20:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll know it's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gotta kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see your fury, your\Nrage, your insane sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me for old time's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.07,0:21:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I type 54, Blackstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he have that gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be stronger, so strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.53,0:22:13.33,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.53,0:22:13.33,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k87}Mo{\k41}tto {\k48}tsu{\k23}yo{\k82}ku {\k34}sou {\k41}tsu{\k22}yo{\k87}ku {\k25}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k42}i {\k48}to {\k43}ne{\k46}ga{\k42}tta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be stronger.\NSo I want to be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be more sad.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.33,0:22:17.25,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Overcoming my grief
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.33,0:22:17.25,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k26}Ka{\k18}na{\k26}shi{\k47}mi {\k20}wo {\k45}ko{\k45}e{\k165}te
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.13,0:22:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a change in my past.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.46,0:22:28.01,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've turned my back so many times
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.46,0:22:28.01,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k28}Ka{\k45}wa{\k22}ru {\k46}ko{\k44}to {\k42}nai {\k24}ka{\k23}ko {\k81}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.01,0:22:31.64,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On the past that will never change
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.01,0:22:31.64,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k33}Na{\k45}n{\k22}do {\k38}mo {\k51}se {\k42}wo {\k23}mu{\k21}ke{\k47}te{\k41}ta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen any of my wounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.64,0:22:39.02,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}While hiding the scars I can never show anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.64,0:22:39.02,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k27}Da{\k44}re {\k22}ni {\k48}mo {\k42}mi{\k48}se{\k22}ra{\k19}re {\k47}nai {\k16}ki{\k30}zu {\k44}wo {\k21}ka{\k17}ku{\k51}shi{\k21}ta {\k26}ma{\k37}ma {\k49}zu{\k107}tto
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.02,0:22:46.15,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I will embrace all this pain that has started flooding through me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.02,0:22:46.15,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k23}A{\k30}fu{\k22}re {\k16}da{\k24}shi{\k24}ta {\k24}ko{\k22}no {\k23}i{\k24}ta{\k23}mi {\k99}wa {\k32}su{\k19}be{\k18}te {\k30}hi{\k23}to{\k21}ri {\k24}de {\k20}da{\k16}ki {\k30}shi{\k26}me{\k100}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.89,0:22:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need one more.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.11,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I don't need warmth at all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.11,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k32}It{\k22}su{\k21}ka {\k24}ki{\k23}e{\k21}ru {\k22}nu{\k23}ku{\k26}mo{\k20}ri {\k22}na{\k40}ra
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need one more.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.11,0:22:53.74,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If it will vanish one day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.11,0:22:53.74,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k24}Hi{\k21}to{\k26}tsu {\k46}mo {\k24}i{\k41}ra{\k44}nai {\k237}yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.74,0:23:01.67,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.74,0:23:01.67,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k98}Mo{\k46}tto {\k44}tsu{\k23}yo{\k88}ku {\k29}sou {\k40}tsu{\k22}yo{\k91}ku {\k21}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k45}i {\k44}to {\k45}ne{\k44}ga{\k44}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.67,0:23:08.09,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Like a lonely star racing across the darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.67,0:23:08.09,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k23}Ku{\k21}ra{\k21}ya{\k48}mi {\k22}wo {\k43}ka{\k48}ke{\k131}ru {\k26}ko{\k20}do{\k23}ku {\k43}na {\k21}ho{\k48}shi {\k20}no {\k25}you {\k59}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.09,0:23:15.85,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sunk so deep inside my heart, I'm so weak and fragile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.09,0:23:15.85,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k53}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.85,0:23:22.94,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I can't put it into words, or even speak out
