Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.07,0:23:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.94,0:23:27.98,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm just waiting for the light
